      "summary": {
        "zh": "祥旭门是毓庆宫建筑序列中的一座门。故宫出版物的具名平面将其标在前星门之后、惇本殿院前；独立题名的正面照片可见黄琉璃门顶、绿色框饰、两侧装饰面板、红色双扇门和浅色石基。这里的介绍与前星门、惇本殿分别对应，不把它们合为一个景点。",
        "en": "Xiangxu Gate is part of the architectural sequence of Yuqing Palace. A named plan in a Palace Museum publication places it after Qianxing Gate and before the Dunben Hall courtyard. A separately captioned front photograph shows a yellow glazed top, green framing, ornamental panels on both sides, red double doors and pale stone feet. This entry is distinct from Qianxing Gate and Dunben Hall.",
