        "en": "The identity, sequence and visible front features were checked against saved page images from Palace Museum publications, without a new visit to the complete web pages. The photograph date, exact dimensions, rear elevation and fine ornament remain unverified. The English name and description are project translations; an official English name for this gate has not been verified."
